1
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:50,580
Since I was ordered to find the lost stars

2
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,600
to save the Divine Clan from its collapsing fate,

3
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:54,130
it has been a hundred years.

4
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:58,280
But there is still no clue about the whereabouts of the last star.

5
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,370
Please guide me, Divine Envoy.

6
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,760
Tang Zhiluo.

7
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,980
A wise ruler has been born.

8
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,880
You must go to his side

9
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:19,600
and help him become a great ruler.

10
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:22,000
Only then can you obtain the star

11
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,530
and complete your mission.

12
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:48,160
I have sealed your magic.

13
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:51,200
Your combat power is only slightly higher than an ordinary person's.

14
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:53,130
You still need to rely on your wits.

15
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,200
Who are you?

16
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,730
Who exactly are you?

17
00:03:34,079 --> 00:03:35,079
Give it back to me.

18
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:38,760
I am here to assist you in becoming a wise ruler.

19
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:42,280
If you could really go back,

20
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:45,140
there wouldn't have been that scam just now.

21
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,930
Since you can't go home now anyway,

22
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,400
why not take me as your master

23
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,329
and learn some real skills from me?

24
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,960
If you don't speak,

25
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,480
I'll take it as a yes.

26
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,970
Here, a welcome gift from your master.

27
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,540
Here, be careful of the bones.

28
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,330
Jingzhou was well managed.

29
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:34,680
My father intends to name an heir and ordered me back.

30
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,600
That's a good thing.

31
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,200
Let's pack our things

32
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,530
and leave immediately.

33
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:45,760
I've been in touch with the capital,

34
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,040
but I didn't tell you.

35
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,500
You don't blame me?

36
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,800
It's your strategy.

37
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,280
Why would I blame you?

38
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,659
But I don't want to go back now.

39
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,360
Why?

40
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:03,720
You have so many skills now.

41
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,360
If you don't return to the capital,

42
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,560
how will you use them?

43
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,400
I just feel

44
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:19,600
living here with you is quite nice.

45
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,960
Excuse me, does Prince Shuo live here?

46
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,840
You have been away from the capital for a year, Your Highness.

47
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:55,080
Seeing this scenery,

48
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,730
what are your thoughts?

49
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:59,520
Sacrificing to heaven and earth with elegance,

50
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,520
a mortal dragon is not what I desire.

51
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,560
Miss Tang, have you found anything?

52
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,160
The terrain here is complex.

53
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:25,100
It's very easy to hide after dark,

54
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:27,800
making it an excellent place for an ambush.

55
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:10,560
Are you okay?

56
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:14,560
Judging by their moves, they look like assassins raised by Jingzhou.

57
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:16,690
We can't leave unless we kill them all.

58
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,960
His Highness hasn't even reached the capital's gates,

59
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:21,290
yet the assassins have already caught up.

60
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:25,160
It seems we must not show any mercy upon returning to the capital.
